{"task_id": "budget-variance-fx-001", "category": "variance_analysis", "difficulty": "medium", "model": "claude-fable-5 (subagent harness)", "mode": "chat", "score": 1.0, "parsed": true, "error": null, "fields": [{"name": "total_budget_usd", "expected": 12783500.0, "got": 12783500, "correct": true, "weight": 1.0}, {"name": "total_actual_usd", "expected": 13110686.2176, "got": 13110686.2176, "correct": true, "weight": 1.0}, {"name": "total_variance_usd", "expected": 327186.2176, "got": 327186.2176, "correct": true, "weight": 1.5}, {"name": "fx_variance_usd", "expected": -2291.9724, "got": -2291.9724, "correct": true, "weight": 1.5}, {"name": "organic_variance_usd", "expected": 329478.19, "got": 329478.19, "correct": true, "weight": 1.5}, {"name": "largest_organic_overspend_dept", "expected": "APAC Ops", "got": "APAC Ops", "correct": true, "weight": 1.5}], "judge_notes": "", "latency_s": null, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "response_text": "# Opex variance: FX vs organic \u2014 solution (chat condition, longhand arithmetic)\n\n## Step 1: Budget USD (budget_local x budget_fx_rate_to_usd)\n\n- Engineering: 1,050,000 x 1.0 = 1,050,000\n- Sales: 600,000 x 1.0 = 600,000\n- Marketing: 2,100,000 x 1.27 = 2,667,000\n- Customer Success: 1,650,000 x 1.08 = 1,782,000\n- G&A: 2,100,000 x 1.0 = 2,100,000\n- EMEA Ops: 1,475,000 x 1.08 = 1,593,000\n- APAC Ops: 262,500,000 x 0.0068 = 1,785,000\n- Data & Analytics: 950,000 x 1.27 = 1,206,500\n\nTotal budget USD = 1,050,000 + 600,000 + 2,667,000 + 1,782,000 + 2,100,000\n+ 1,593,000 + 1,785,000 + 1,206,500 = 12,783,500\n\n## Step 2: Actual USD (actual_local x actual_fx_rate_to_usd)\n\n- Engineering: 1,016,435 x 1.0 = 1,016,435\n- Sales: 702,390 x 1.0 = 702,390\n- Marketing: 1,989,634 x 1.3009\n  = 1,989,634 x 1.3 (2,586,524.20) + 1,989,634 x 0.0009 (1,790.6706)\n  = 2,588,314.8706\n- Customer Success: 1,511,755 x 1.0504\n  = 1,511,755 + 1,511,755 x 0.05 (75,587.75) + 1,511,755 x 0.0004 (604.702)\n  = 1,587,947.452\n- G&A: 2,152,784 x 1.0 = 2,152,784\n- EMEA Ops: 1,711,350 x 1.1313\n  = 1,711,350 + 171,135 (x0.1) + 51,340.5 (x0.03) + 2,224.755 (x0.0013)\n  = 1,936,050.255\n- APAC Ops: 302,590,100 x 0.0066 = 1,997,094.66\n- Data & Analytics: 925,959 x 1.22 = 925,959 + 203,710.98 = 1,129,669.98\n\nTotal actual USD:\n1,016,435 + 702,390 = 1,718,825\n+ 2,588,314.8706 = 4,307,139.8706\n+ 1,587,947.452 = 5,895,087.3226\n+ 2,152,784 = 8,047,871.3226\n+ 1,936,050.255 = 9,983,921.5776\n+ 1,997,094.66 = 11,981,016.2376\n+ 1,129,669.98 = 13,110,686.2176\n\nTotal actual USD = 13,110,686.2176\n\n## Step 3: Total variance\n\n13,110,686.2176 - 12,783,500 = 327,186.2176 (overspend)\n\n## Step 4: FX variance = sum of actual_local x (actual_rate - budget_rate)\n\n- Engineering, Sales, G&A (USD): rate delta 0 -> 0\n- Marketing: 1,989,634 x (1.3009 - 1.27) = 1,989,634 x 0.0309\n  = 59,689.02 + 1,790.6706 = 61,479.6906\n- Customer Success: 1,511,755 x (1.0504 - 1.08) = 1,511,755 x (-0.0296)\n  = -(45,352.65 - 604.702) = -44,747.948\n- EMEA Ops: 1,711,350 x (1.1313 - 1.08) = 1,711,350 x 0.0513\n  = 85,567.5 + 2,224.755 = 87,792.255\n- APAC Ops: 302,590,100 x (0.0066 - 0.0068) = 302,590,100 x (-0.0002)\n  = -60,518.02\n- Data & Analytics: 925,959 x (1.22 - 1.27) = 925,959 x (-0.05) = -46,297.95\n\nSum: 61,479.6906 - 44,747.948 = 16,731.7426\n+ 87,792.255 = 104,523.9976\n- 60,518.02 = 44,005.9776\n- 46,297.95 = -2,291.9724\n\nFX variance = -2,291.9724 USD\n\n## Step 5: Organic variance = sum of (actual_local - budget_local) x budget_rate\n\n- Engineering: (1,016,435 - 1,050,000) x 1.0 = -33,565\n- Sales: (702,390 - 600,000) x 1.0 = +102,390\n- Marketing: (1,989,634 - 2,100,000) x 1.27 = -110,366 x 1.27\n  = -(110,366 + 29,798.82) = -140,164.82\n- Customer Success: (1,511,755 - 1,650,000) x 1.08 = -138,245 x 1.08\n  = -(138,245 + 11,059.6) = -149,304.60\n- G&A: (2,152,784 - 2,100,000) x 1.0 = +52,784\n- EMEA Ops: (1,711,350 - 1,475,000) x 1.08 = 236,350 x 1.08\n  = 236,350 + 18,908 = +255,258\n- APAC Ops: (302,590,100 - 262,500,000) x 0.0068 = 40,090,100 x 0.0068\n  = 272,612.68\n- Data & Analytics: (925,959 - 950,000) x 1.27 = -24,041 x 1.27\n  = -(24,041 + 6,491.07) = -30,532.07\n\nSum: -33,565 + 102,390 = 68,825\n- 140,164.82 = -71,339.82\n- 149,304.60 = -220,644.42\n+ 52,784 = -167,860.42\n+ 255,258 = 87,397.58\n+ 272,612.68 = 360,010.26\n- 30,532.07 = 329,478.19\n\nOrganic variance = +329,478.19 USD\n\n## Step 6: Reconciliation check\n\nFX + organic = -2,291.9724 + 329,478.19 = 327,186.2176 = total variance. Exact match.\n\n## Step 7: Largest organic overspend department\n\nPositive organic variances: Sales 102,390; G&A 52,784; EMEA Ops 255,258;\nAPAC Ops 272,612.68. Largest = APAC Ops.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"total_budget_usd\": 12783500,\n  \"total_actual_usd\": 13110686.2176,\n  \"total_variance_usd\": 327186.2176,\n  \"fx_variance_usd\": -2291.9724,\n  \"organic_variance_usd\": 329478.19,\n  \"largest_organic_overspend_dept\": \"APAC Ops\"\n}\n```\n", "trial": 0}
{"task_id": "capital-allocation-001", "category": "corporate_finance", "difficulty": "medium", "model": "claude-fable-5 (subagent harness)", "mode": "chat", "score": 0.6666666666666666, "parsed": true, "error": null, "fields": [{"name": "wacc_pct", "expected": 8.3889, "got": 8.3889, "correct": true, "weight": 1.5}, {"name": "npv_project_a", "expected": 6353.8641, "got": 6440.83, "correct": false, "weight": 1.5}, {"name": "npv_project_b", "expected": 4752.3571, "got": 4872.66, "correct": false, "weight": 1.5}, {"name": "irr_project_a_pct", "expected": 26.4945, "got": 26.49, "correct": true, "weight": 1.0}, {"name": "irr_project_b_pct", "expected": 16.3178, "got": 16.32, "correct": true, "weight": 1.0}, {"name": "payback_years_project_a", "expected": 2.1201, "got": 2.1201, "correct": true, "weight": 1.0}, {"name": "recommended_project", "expected": "A", "got": "A", "correct": true, "weight": 1.5}], "judge_notes": "", "latency_s": null, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "response_text": "# Capital Allocation \u2014 Chat Condition (manual reasoning)\n\n## Step 1: WACC\n\nCost of equity (CAPM) = 3.71 + 1.06 x 5.47\n  1.06 x 5.47 = 5.7982\n  Cost of equity = 3.71 + 5.7982 = 9.5082%\n\nAfter-tax cost of debt = 8.43 x (1 - 0.25) = 8.43 x 0.75 = 6.3225%\n\nMarket values: D = 39,000; E = 72,000; D+E = 111,000\n  Equity weight = 72,000/111,000\n  Debt weight   = 39,000/111,000\n\nWACC = (72 x 9.5082 + 39 x 6.3225) / 111\n     = (684.5904 + 246.5775) / 111\n     = 931.1679 / 111\n     = 8.3889%  (exactly: 111 x 8.3889 = 931.1679)\n\n## Step 2: Discount factors at WACC (r = 0.083889)\n\n(1+r)^1 = 1.083889\n(1+r)^2 = 1 + 2(0.083889) + 0.083889^2 = 1 + 0.167778 + 0.00703736 = 1.16781536\n(1+r)^3 = 1.16781536 x 1.083889 = 1.16781536 + 0.09796686 = 1.26578222\n(1+r)^4 = 1.26578222 x 1.083889 = 1.26578222 + 0.10618521 = 1.37196743\n(1+r)^5 = 1.37196743 x 1.083889 = 1.37196743 + 0.11509297 = 1.48706040\n\n## Step 3: NPV Project A (CF: -15500, 7961.94, 6900.35, 5307.96, 3715.57, 2653.98)\n\nY1: 7961.94 / 1.083889   = 7345.715\nY2: 6900.35 / 1.16781536 = 5908.768\nY3: 5307.96 / 1.26578222 = 4193.423\nY4: 3715.57 / 1.37196743 = 2708.206\nY5: 2653.98 / 1.48706040 = 1784.716\n\nSum of PV inflows = 7345.715 + 5908.768 + 4193.423 + 2708.206 + 1784.716 = 21940.828\nNPV_A = 21940.828 - 15500 = 6440.83\n\n## Step 4: NPV Project B (CF: -17500, 2366.24, 4140.93, 5915.61, 7690.29, 9464.98)\n\nY1: 2366.24 / 1.083889   = 2183.102\nY2: 4140.93 / 1.16781536 = 3545.877\nY3: 5915.61 / 1.26578222 = 4673.482\nY4: 7690.29 / 1.37196743 = 5605.301\nY5: 9464.98 / 1.48706040 = 6364.893\n\nSum of PV inflows = 2183.102 + 3545.877 + 4673.482 + 5605.301 + 6364.893 = 22372.655\nNPV_B = 22372.655 - 17500 = 4872.66\n\n## Step 5: IRR Project A (manual iteration)\n\nAt 25% (factors 1.25, 1.5625, 1.953125, 2.44140625, 3.0517578):\n  Y1 7961.94 x 0.8      = 6369.552\n  Y2 6900.35 x 0.64     = 4416.224\n  Y3 5307.96 x 0.512    = 2717.675\n  Y4 3715.57 x 0.4096   = 1521.897\n  Y5 2653.98 x 0.32768  =  869.657\n  Sum = 15895.005 -> NPV = +395.01\n\nAt 27% (factors 1.27, 1.6129, 2.048383, 2.60144641, 3.303837):\n  Y1 = 6269.240; Y2 = 4278.226; Y3 = 2591.292; Y4 = 1428.271; Y5 = 803.302\n  Sum = 15370.331 -> NPV = -129.67\n\nAt 26.5% (factors 1.265, 1.600225, 2.024285, 2.560721, 3.239312):\n  Y1 = 6294.024; Y2 = 4312.112; Y3 = 2622.141; Y4 = 1450.986; Y5 = 819.303\n  Sum = 15498.566 -> NPV = -1.43\n\nLocal slope between 26.5% and 27%: (-129.67 - (-1.43)) / 0.5 = -256.5 per 1%\nIRR_A = 26.5 - 1.43/256.5 = 26.494% -> 26.49%\n\n## Step 6: IRR Project B (manual iteration)\n\nAt 16% (factors 1.16, 1.3456, 1.560896, 1.81063936, 2.10034166):\n  Y1 = 2039.862; Y2 = 3077.386; Y3 = 3789.881; Y4 = 4247.278; Y5 = 4506.404\n  Sum = 17660.811 -> NPV = +160.81\n\nAt 17% (factors 1.17, 1.3689, 1.601613, 1.87388721, 2.19244804):\n  Y1 = 2022.427; Y2 = 3025.005; Y3 = 3693.533; Y4 = 4103.924; Y5 = 4317.083\n  Sum = 17161.972 -> NPV = -338.03\n\nAt 16.3% (factors 1.163, 1.352569, 1.573038, 1.829443, 2.127642):\n  Y1 = 2034.601; Y2 = 3061.529; Y3 = 3760.629; Y4 = 4203.624; Y5 = 4448.578\n  Sum = 17508.961 -> NPV = +8.96\n\nLocal slope between 16.3% and 17%: (-338.03 - 8.96) / 0.7 = -495.7 per 1%\nIRR_B = 16.3 + 8.96/495.7 = 16.318% -> 16.32%\n\n## Step 7: Simple payback, Project A (undiscounted)\n\nCumulative:\n  after Y1: -15500 + 7961.94 = -7538.06\n  after Y2: -7538.06 + 6900.35 = -637.71\n  Y3 cash flow = 5307.96 -> crosses zero in year 3\nFraction = 637.71 / 5307.96 = 0.1201\nPayback_A = 2 + 0.1201 = 2.1201 years\n\n## Step 8: Recommendation\n\nNPV_A (6440.83) > NPV_B (4872.66) at WACC -> recommend Project A.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"wacc_pct\": 8.3889,\n  \"npv_project_a\": 6440.83,\n  \"npv_project_b\": 4872.66,\n  \"irr_project_a_pct\": 26.49,\n  \"irr_project_b_pct\": 16.32,\n  \"payback_years_project_a\": 2.1201,\n  \"recommended_project\": \"A\"\n}\n```\n", "trial": 0}
