3\nM6 retention = 1991.93 / 3845.47 x 100 = 51.80%\n\n## Step 3: April cohort\n\nMonth 0 (2025-04) revenue:\nC152 357.46, C153 469.27, C154 271.06, C155 261.57, C156 398.71, C157 160.61, C158 349.32,\nC159 316.81, C160 204.52, C161 253.22, C162 141.21, C163 94.67, C164 309.78, C165 356.18,\nC166 430.67, C167 198.96, C168 343.21, C169 145.50, C170 159.93\nSum = 5222.66\n\nM3 = 2025-07 revenue from Apr-cohort customers:\nC152 338.08, C154 313.70, C155 155.17, C156 232.53, C157 180.30, C159 217.20, C160 153.00,\nC162 133.93, C163 118.52, C164 256.81, C165 353.76, C166 296.43, C169 203.38, C170 202.62\nSum = 3155.43\nM3 retention = 3155.43 / 5222.66 x 100 = 60.42%\n\n## Step 4: M3 retention for all cohorts Jan\u2013Jun (to find the best)\n\n- Jan: 2657.75 / 3845.47 = 69.11%\n- Feb: month 0 (2025-02) = 7124.79; M3 (2025-05) = 5402.04 -> 75.82%\n- Mar: month 0 (2025-03) = 6907.51; M3 (2025-06) = 3638.45 -> 52.67%\n- Apr: 3155.43 / 5222.66 = 60.42%\n- May: month 0 (2025-05) = 6555.43; M3 (2025-08) = 4441.27 -> 67.75%\n- Jun: month 0 (2025-06) = 4090.02; M3 (2025-09) = 3838.82 -> 93.86%\n\nBest M3 revenue retention cohort: 2025-06 (93.86%).\n\nAll sums were verified with a second, independent pairwise-addition pass.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"jan_cohort_customers\": 12,\n  \"jan_cohort_month0_revenue\": 3845.47,\n  \"jan_cohort_m3_retention_pct\": 69.11,\n  \"jan_cohort_m6_retention_pct\": 51.80,\n  \"apr_cohort_m3_retention_pct\": 60.42,\n  \"best_m3_retention_cohort\": \"2025-06\"\n}\n```\n", "trial": 0}
{"task_id": "error-detection-001", "category": "review_and_controls", "difficulty": "medium", "model": "claude-fable-5 (subagent harness)", "mode": "chat", "score": 1.0, "parsed": true, "error": null, "fields": [{"name": "correct_gross_profit", "expected": 34474, "got": 34474, "correct": true, "weight": 1}, {"name": "correct_total_operating_expenses", "expected": 29517, "got": 29517, "correct": true, "weight": 1}, {"name": "correct_operating_income", "expected": 2121, "got": 2121, "correct": true, "weight": 1.5}, {"name": "correct_pretax_income", "expected": 1085, "got": 1085, "correct": true, "weight": 1}, {"name": "correct_tax_expense", "expected": 271, "got": 271, "correct": true, "weight": 1}, {"name": "correct_net_income", "expected": 814, "got": 814, "correct": true, "weight": 1.5}], "judge_notes": "", "latency_s": null, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "response_text": "# P&L Error Detection \u2014 Corrected Subtotals\n\nAll figures in $ thousands. Components (authoritative): revenue 66,500; cogs 32,026;\nS&M 13,577; R&D 11,474; G&A 4,466; depreciation 2,836; interest 1,036; tax rate 25%.\n\nStep-by-step recomputation:\n\n1. Gross profit = revenue - cogs = 66,500 - 32,026 = 34,474\n   (check: 32,026 + 34,474 = 66,500). Reported 31,966 -> WRONG.\n\n2. Total operating expenses = 13,577 + 11,474 + 4,466\n   = 25,051 + 4,466 = 29,517\n   (check: 13,577 + 11,474 = 25,051; 25,051 + 4,466 = 29,517). Reported 31,401 -> WRONG.\n\n3. Operating income = gross_profit - total_opex - depreciation\n   = 34,474 - 29,517 - 2,836 = 4,957 - 2,836 = 2,121. Reported 2,446 -> WRONG.\n\n4. Pretax income = operating_income - interest_expense\n   = 2,121 - 1,036 = 1,085. Reported 1,063 -> WRONG.\n\n5. Tax expense = 25% x 1,085 = 271.25 -> rounds to 271. Reported 400 -> WRONG.\n\n6. Net income = 1,085 - 271 = 814. Reported 861 -> WRONG.\n\nVerification chain: 271 + 814 = 1,085; 1,036 + 1,085 = 2,121; 2,836 + 2,121 = 4,957;\n29,517 + 4,957 = 34,474; 32,026 + 34,474 = 66,500