50\nAll other channels have zero-or-negative contribution per order -> skipped.\n\n## Step 4: Totals\noptimal_total_orders = 3,750\noptimal_total_contribution = 3,750 x 87.97204\n  = 87.97204 x 3,000 = 263,916.12\n  + 87.97204 x 750 = 65,979.03\n  = 329,895.15\nunspent_budget = 325,912.50\n\n```json\n{\n  \"best_channel_by_contribution_per_cac_dollar\": \"Affiliates\",\n  \"best_channel_contribution_per_order\": 87.97204,\n  \"optimal_total_orders\": 3750,\n  \"optimal_total_contribution\": 329895.15,\n  \"unspent_budget\": 325912.50\n}\n```\n", "trial": 0}
