_i\n- Alpha:   (-12.95) x 7969 = -103,198.55\n- Bravo:   (+6.34)  x 6147 =  +38,971.98\n- Cortex:  (-11.96) x 6781 =  -81,100.76\n- Delta:   (+7.37)  x 1650 =  +12,160.50\n- Echo:    (+3.06)  x 1841 =   +5,633.46\n- Foxtrot: (-1.11)  x 3763 =   -4,176.93\nPrice variance = -131,710.30\n\n## Step 6: Volume variance = (AQ_tot - BQ_tot) x P_bar\n= (28,151 - 30,450) x P_bar = -2,299 x 3,953,846.50 / 30,450\n= -9,089,893,103.50 / 30,450 = -298,518.6569 -> -298,518.66\n\n## Step 7: Mix variance = sum (AQ_i - AQ_tot x BQ_i/BQ_tot) x BP_i\nEquivalent form: sum(AQ_i x BP_i) - AQ_tot x P_bar\nsum(AQ_i x BP_i):\n- Alpha:   7969 x 187.58 = 1,494,825.02\n- Bravo:   6147 x 114.93 =   706,474.71\n- Cortex:  6781 x 148.60 = 1,007,656.60\n- Delta:   1650 x 136.39 =   225,043.50\n- Echo:    1841 x  50.88 =    93,670.08\n- Foxtrot: 3763 x  35.33 =   132,946.79\nSum = 3,660,616.70\nAQ_tot x P_bar = 28,151 x 3,953,846.50 / 30,450 = 111,304,732,821.50 / 30,450 = 3,655,327.8431\nMix variance = 3,660,616.70 - 3,655,327.8431 = +5,288.8569 -> +5,288.86\n\n## Step 8: Reconciliation\nPrice + Volume + Mix = -131,710.30 + (-298,518.6569) + 5,288.8569 = -424,940.10\n= Total revenue variance. Ties out exactly.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"budget_revenue\": 3953846.50,\n  \"actual_revenue\": 3528906.40,\n  \"total_revenue_variance\": -424940.10,\n  \"price_variance\": -131710.30,\n  \"volume_variance\": -298518.66,\n  \"mix_variance\": 5288.86\n}\n```\n", "trial": 0}
